          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami sikuona hekalu ndani yake; kwa maana Bwana Mungu Mwenyezi na Mwana-Kondoo, ndio hekalu lake.",
